<title>SOUTH KOREA: LG Int'l to take 10 pct of HK's Zhongya.</title>
<headline>LG Int'l to take 10 pct of HK's Zhongya.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's LG International Corp, a unit of LG Group, said on Thursday it had agreed to acquire a 10 percent stake of Zhongya Shape Aluminium Ltd in Hong Kong for $1.8 million.</p>
<p>LG International said in a statement that it would supply Zhongya with 30,000 tonnes of aluminium worth $48 million a year following the stake acquisition.</p>
<p>It said the Hong Kong-based Zhongya annually produced $64 million of aluminium sashes and had a plant at Nanhai city in Guangdong province, China.</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5651</p>
